---

<BaseLayout
  title="Tote Bag Seminar Custom untuk Berbagai Acara | ToteBag"
  description="Pesan tote bag seminar custom untuk kantor, kampus, workshop, dan instansi. Bandingkan bahan, ukuran, desain logo, dan paket seminar kit. Konsultasi sekarang."
  canonicalUrl="https://totebag.web.id/tote-bag-seminar/"
  ogImage="https://totebag.web.id/media/tote-bag-seminar-kit-canvas.webp"
  jsonLd={schemaJson}
>
  <!-- Topbar Context Bar -->
  <aside class="seminar-topbar py-2 text-center text-white small" aria-label="Informasi layanan">
    <div class="container">
      Kebutuhan seminar, workshop, kampus &amp; pengadaan perusahaan • Konsultasi spesifikasi melalui WhatsApp
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- Breadcrumbs & Quick Anchor Navigation -->
  <div class="container pt-3">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />
    <nav class="quick-nav d-none d-md-flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 pb-1" aria-label="Navigasi cepat halaman">
      <span class="small fw-semibold text-muted align-self-center me-1">Lompat ke:</span>
      <a href="#bahan" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Pilihan Bahan</a>
      <a href="#acara" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Jenis Acara</a>
      <a href="#ukuran" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Ukuran &amp; Kapasitas</a>
      <a href="#branding" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Desain Logo</a>
      <a href="#paket" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Paket &amp; Harga Kit</a>
      <a href="#biaya" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Cost per Use</a>
      <a href="#proses" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Alur Order</a>
      <a href="#faq" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">FAQ</a>
      <a href="#penawaran" class="badge badge-cta text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Minta Penawaran ↗</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="section-space-sm pt-3 pb-5 hero-seminar" id="konten">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-4 g-lg-5">
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="badge-accent">Solusi tas seminar &amp; event B2B</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="hero-title mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.8vw, 3.2rem);">
            Tote Bag Seminar Custom untuk Berbagai Acara
          </h1>
          <p class="lead text-muted fs-5 mb-4" style="line-height: 1.75;">
            Tote bag seminar custom adalah tas acara yang dibuat sesuai kebutuhan peserta dan identitas penyelenggara. Pilih bahan, ukuran, warna, serta penempatan logo berdasarkan isi seminar kit, jumlah peserta, dan jenis acara—mulai dari workshop kampus hingga konferensi perusahaan.
          </p>
          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-4">
            <a href="#penawaran" class="btn btn-brand btn-lg">
              Konsultasi &amp; Minta Penawaran
            </a>
            <a href="#bahan" class="btn btn-brand-outline btn-lg">
              Bandingkan Bahan
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="small text-muted mb-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-shield-check text-success me-1 align-text-bottom" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5.338 1.59a61 61 0 0 0-2.837.856.48.48 0 0 0-.328.39c-.554 4.157.726 7.19 2.253 9.188a10.7 10.7 0 0 0 2.287 2.233c.346.244.652.42.893.533q.18.085.293.118a1 1 0 0 0 .101.025 1 1 0 0 0 .1-.025q.114-.034.294-.118c.24-.113.547-.29.893-.533a10.7 10.7 0 0 0 2.287-2.233c1.527-1.997 2.807-5.031 2.253-9.188a.48.48 0 0 0-.328-.39c-.651-.213-1.75-.56-2.837-.855C9.552 1.29 8.531 1.067 8 1.067c-.53 0-1.552.223-2.662.524zM5.072.56C6.157.265 7.31 0 8 0s1.843.265 2.928.56c1.11.3 2.229.655 2.887.87a1.54 1.54 0 0 1 1.044 1.262c.596 4.477-.787 7.795-2.464 9.99a11.8 11.8 0 0 1-2.517 2.453 7 7 0 0 1-1.048.625c-.28.132-.581.24-.829.24s-.548-.108-.829-.24a7 7 0 0 1-1.048-.625 11.8 11.8 0 0 1-2.517-2.453C1.928 10.487.545 7.169 1.141 2.692A1.54 1.54 0 0 1 2.185 1.43 63 63 0 0 1 5.072.56"/>
              <path d="M10.854 5.146a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-3 3a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-1.5-1.5a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.708L7.5 7.793l2.646-2.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0"/>
            </svg>
            Pemesanan berdasarkan brief • Mockup dan spesifikasi dikonfirmasi • Berbasis Malang
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5">
          <div class="ratio ratio-4x3 rounded-4 overflow-hidden border shadow-sm">
            <img 
              src="/media/tote-bag-seminar-kit-canvas.webp" 
              alt="Tote bag seminar kit custom bahan canvas lengkap dengan tumbler dan notes" 
              width="724" 
              height="543" 
              class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover"
              loading="eager"
              fetchpriority="high"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 Benefit Cards / KPIs -->
  <section class="py-2 py-md-3 mb-4" aria-label="Ringkasan kebutuhan">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-2 row-cols-lg-4 g-3">
        <div class="col">
          <div class="card h-100 p-3 p-md-4 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm">
            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border align-self-start mb-2">Fleksibilitas</span>
            <strong class="text-dark fs-6 d-block mb-1">Untuk berbagai acara</strong>
            <span class="text-muted small">Seminar, workshop, rapat, pelatihan &amp; expo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
          <div class="card h-100 p-3 p-md-4 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm">
            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border align-self-start mb-2">Varian Kain</span>
            <strong class="text-dark fs-6 d-block mb-1">Material fleksibel</strong>
            <span class="text-muted small">Blacu, spunbond, canvas, drill dan lainnya</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
          <div class="card h-100 p-3 p-md-4 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm">
            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border align-self-start mb-2">Aplikasi Logo</span>
            <strong class="text-dark fs-6 d-block mb-1">Branding custom</strong>
            <span class="text-muted small">Logo, warna, teks acara &amp; aksesori</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col">
          <div class="card h-100 p-3 p-md-4 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm">
            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border align-self-start mb-2">Transparan</span>
            <strong class="text-dark fs-6 d-block mb-1">Alur pengadaan jelas</strong>
            <span class="text-muted small">Brief, penawaran, approval, QC &amp; pengiriman</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 05: Mengapa tote bag seminar penting bagi pengalaman peserta? + TOC -->
  <section class="section-space pt-4 pb-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-75 mb-4">
        <span class="badge-accent mb-2">Panduan pemilihan</span>
        <h2 class="section-title mb-3">Mengapa tote bag seminar penting bagi pengalaman peserta?</h2>
        <p class="text-muted fs-6" style="line-height: 1.8;">
          Tas seminar bukan hanya wadah dokumen. Tas yang nyaman dibawa membantu peserta menyimpan modul dan perlengkapan sepanjang acara; identitas visual pada tas juga dapat memperpanjang paparan merek ketika tas digunakan kembali. Manfaat tersebut bergantung pada desain, kualitas material, serta kebiasaan penggunaan penerima—bukan jaminan hasil branding.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
        <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
          <div class="card h-100 p-4 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm">
            <span class="badge bg-light text-brand align-self-start mb-3 fw-bold">01 / Fungsional</span>
            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">Perlengkapan lebih tertata</h3>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
              Gabungkan stopmap, modul, alat tulis, lanyard, dan tumbler dalam satu tas yang ukurannya sesuai.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
          <div class="card h-100 p-4 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm">
            <span class="badge bg-light text-brand align-self-start mb-3 fw-bold">02 / Branding</span>
            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">Identitas acara terlihat</h3>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
              Tempatkan logo dan nama acara secara proporsional agar tetap mudah dibaca tanpa memenuhi seluruh permukaan tas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
          <div class="card h-100 p-4 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm">
            <span class="badge bg-light text-brand align-self-start mb-3 fw-bold">03 / Pengalaman</span>
            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">Layak digunakan kembali</h3>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
